#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:304
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "The first 7 days make or break an affiliate"
msgstr "头 7 天决定联属会员的成败"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:305
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "If an affiliate doesn't make their first sale within a week, there's a good chance they'll disappear. Don't let that happen!<br />Give them an easy win upfront by sending a quick-start guide, pre-made marketing materials, and personal onboarding tips."
msgstr "如果联属会员在一周内没有完成第一笔销售，他们很有可能会消失。不要让这种情况发生！<br />通过发送快速入门指南、预制营销材料和个人入职提示，让他们在前期轻松获胜。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:309
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Affiliate fatigue is real"
msgstr "联属会员疲劳是真实存在的"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:310
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Here's the truth: even top affiliates get tired if promotions feel repetitive or rewards aren't exciting. And when they check out mentally, your sales dip.<br />So keep them engaged with fresh incentives, such as limited-time bonuses, surprise commission boosts, and new promotional angles. The more variety you offer, the longer they stay motivated."
msgstr "事实是：如果促销活动感觉重复或奖励不令人兴奋，即使是顶级联属会员也会感到厌倦。<br />因此，要通过新鲜的激励措施（如限时奖金、惊喜佣金提升和新的促销角度）让他们参与进来。您提供的奖励越丰富，他们保持积极性的时间就越长。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:314
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Stay in your affiliates' inbox—Before they forget you"
msgstr "留在联属会员的收件箱中--在他们忘记你之前"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:315
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Affiliates aren't mind-readers. If you don't check in, they'll assume you don't care. A monthly email with performance insights, fresh marketing ideas, and an occasional \"Hey, keeping an eye on your stats—looking interesting!\" can work wonders."
msgstr "联属会员不是读心者。如果你不汇报，他们就会认为你不在乎。每月发送一封电子邮件，介绍业绩见解、新的营销理念，偶尔说一句 \"嘿，我一直在关注你的统计数据，看起来很有趣！\"就能收到奇效。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:319
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Competitors will try to steal your best affiliates"
msgstr "竞争对手会试图窃取您的最佳联属会员"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:320
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Affiliate poaching is a reality. The moment your top affiliates start pulling in serious revenue, competitors will try to lure them with higher commissions.<br />What's your move? Make them stay with VIP perks like exclusive bonuses, early product access, and private performance-based rewards."
msgstr "联属会员被挖角是现实。当您的顶级联属会员开始获得丰厚收入时，竞争对手就会试图用更高的佣金来吸引他们。用 VIP 福利（如独家奖金、提前获得产品和基于业绩的私人奖励）留住他们。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:324
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Focus on the 20% that drive 80% of sales"
msgstr "专注于推动 80% 销售额的 20% 部分"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:325
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Not all affiliates are equal. Most sign up, a few try, but only a handful bring real revenue. Instead of chasing inactive affiliates, double down on your top performers. Give them higher commissions, personal coaching, and VIP support. Rewarding the right people can 10x your results."
msgstr "并非所有联属会员都是平等的。大多数人注册，少数人尝试，但只有少数人能带来真正的收入。与其追逐不活跃的联属会员，不如加倍关注表现优异的联属会员。给他们更高的佣金、个人指导和 VIP 支持。奖励合适的人可以让你的业绩翻 10 倍。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:329
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Refunds kill commissions—and affiliate morale"
msgstr "退款扼杀了佣金和联属会员的士气"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:330
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Affiliates hate seeing commissions vanish because of refunds. If your refund rate is high, expect frustration (and dropouts).<br />The fix? Be upfront about your refund policy, constantly improve product quality, and keep affiliates in the loop about what's working. The more confidence they have in your product, the harder they'll sell it Feature based tips"
msgstr "联属会员讨厌看到佣金因退款而消失。<br />解决方法是什么？直截了当地说明您的退款政策，不断提高产品质量，并让联属会员及时了解产品的效果。他们对您的产品越有信心，就会越卖力。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:334
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Pay affiliates smarter and not harder"
msgstr "向联属会员支付更高的薪酬，而不是更高的薪酬"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:335
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Not all affiliates contribute equally to your revenue—so why pay them the same? Set up flexible commission rules with Affiliate for WooCommerce to reward your top-performing influencers, give better rates to loyal customers, or even set different commissions for specific products, categories, and user roles. Why? Because fair rewards = better results!"
msgstr "并非所有的联属会员都能为您带来同样的收入，为什么要向他们支付相同的报酬呢？使用 WooCommerce 的联属会员功能设置灵活的佣金规则，奖励表现最出色的影响者，为忠实客户提供更优惠的价格，甚至为特定产品、类别和用户角色设置不同的佣金。为什么要这样做？因为公平的奖励 = 更好的结果！"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:339
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Stop affiliate fraud before it costs you"
msgstr "杜绝联属会员欺诈，避免损失"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:340
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Affiliate fraud is real, but you don't have to fall for it. Affiliate for WooCommerce helps you block self-referrals, monitor suspicious IPs, and manually approve affiliates before they join. A little fraud prevention today can save you big losses tomorrow."
msgstr "联属会员欺诈是真实存在的，但您不必上当。WooCommerce 的联属会员功能可帮助您阻止自我推荐、监控可疑 IP，并在联属会员加入前对其进行手动审批。今天预防一下欺诈，明天就能挽回巨大损失。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:344
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Convert better without links chaos"
msgstr "没有混乱的链接，转换效果更好"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:345
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Some buyers avoid clicking affiliate links, which means lost commissions. The fix? Use affiliate landing pages. Instead of relying on links, assign landing pages to your affiliates.<br />This way they can send traffic directly to a dedicated page that tracks their referrals automatically. So no more friction or missed commissions—just better conversions."
msgstr "一些买家避免点击联盟链接，这意味着佣金的损失。解决方法是什么？使用联属会员登陆页面。<br />这样，他们就可以将流量直接发送到一个专门的页面，该页面会自动跟踪他们的推荐。因此，不会再有摩擦或错过佣金，只会有更好的转化率。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:349
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Turn discount coupons into affiliate sales machines"
msgstr "将折扣券变成联属销售机器"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:350
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Not everyone clicks affiliate links, but almost everyone loves a discount. With Affiliate for WooCommerce, you can turn WooCommerce coupons into powerful affiliate tools.<br />Shoppers get a discount, affiliates earn a commission, and you close a sale—while potentially gaining a loyal customer. It's not just a win-win. It's a win-win-win!"
msgstr "不是每个人都会点击联盟链接，但几乎每个人都喜欢折扣。使用 WooCommerce 联属营销工具，您可以将 WooCommerce 优惠券转化为强大的联属营销工具。<br />购物者获得折扣，联属营销工具赚取佣金，您完成销售，同时还可能获得忠诚客户。这不仅仅是双赢。这是一个三赢的局面！"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:354
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Give affiliates everything they need to sell more"
msgstr "为联属会员提供销售更多产品所需的一切"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:355
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "Don't leave your affiliates guessing on how to promote your products. Set up dedicated campaigns to organize your marketing assets—brand creatives, logos, banners, swipes, videos, and guidelines—in one place. No more back-and-forth or confusion.<br />Remember, the easier you make it for them, the more they'll sell—and the more you'll earn."
msgstr "不要让您的联属会员猜测如何推广您的产品。设置专门的营销活动，将您的营销资产--品牌创意、徽标、横幅、刷屏、视频和指南--集中到一个地方。<br />请记住，您让他们做得越轻松，他们就会卖得越多，您就会赚得越多。"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:359
msgctxt "tip title for admin summary email"
msgid "Keep paying affiliates—even for future sales"
msgstr "继续向联属会员支付费用--即使是未来的销售额"

#: includes/admin/class-afwc-admin-summary-reports.php:360
msgctxt "tip content for admin summary email"
msgid "What if your affiliates earned commissions not just once but on every future purchase their referrals made? With Lifetime Commissions in Affiliate for WooCommerce, affiliates earn on every future purchase their referrals make—whether it's next month or next year. Turn one-time efforts into long-term earnings and keep your affiliate motivated."
msgstr "如果您的联属会员不仅能赚取一次佣金，还能从其推荐人未来的每次购物中赚取佣金，那会怎么样？有了 WooCommerce 联属会员中的终身佣金功能，联属会员可以从其推荐人未来的每次购物中赚取佣金--无论是下个月还是明年。将一次性努力转化为长期收益，让您的联属会员保持积极性。"

